    "# LoRA text-to-SQL on a free Colab GPU\n",
    "\n",
    "Runs the whole experiment: baselines, LoRA fine-tune, and the comparison table.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Before you start:** Runtime > Change runtime type > **T4 GPU**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Point this at your copy of the repository.\n",
    "REPO_URL = \"https://github.com/YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME/lora-text-to-sql.git\"\n",
    "\n",
    "!git clone -q $REPO_URL repo\n",
    "%cd repo\n",
    "!pip install -q -e .\n",
    "!nvidia-smi --query-gpu=name,memory.total --format=csv"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Plumbing check (about 30 seconds)\n",
    "A tiny random model is trained on synthetic data. This proves every step runs before you spend GPU time."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!sqltune smoke"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Data: download `b-mc2/sql-create-context`, de-duplicate, split"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!sqltune prepare --n-val 500 --n-test 1000"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Fine-tune with LoRA\n",
    "The defaults train on 10,000 examples for one epoch. `train_seconds` in `outputs/lora/train_summary.json` records how long it took."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!sqltune train --max-train-examples 10000 --batch-size 16"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Compare zero-shot, few-shot and LoRA on the same 1,000 test questions"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!sqltune evaluate --modes zero_shot few_shot lora"
   ]
